= Introduction

Electrons in a channel a few atomic layers wide propagate as waves, so the
drift-diffusion picture of transport as a sum of local scattering events no
longer describes them. Setting up what replaces it is the subject of the course.

The equation the course solves, in one form or another, throughout:
$
  - h.bar^2 / (2 m^*) laplace psi + V_"ext" psi = E psi.
$ <ema-schroedinger>
